WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:01.680
Continuing the lineage

00:02.040 --> 00:03.800
Is the foundation of the state

00:03.880 --> 00:04.800
Harem construction

00:04.880 --> 00:06.280
Cannot be taken lightly

00:07.160 --> 00:08.560
Yes

00:09.520 --> 00:10.440
Then I

00:10.520 --> 00:12.760
Will readjust this year's budget

00:13.040 --> 00:14.680
Once more

00:15.000 --> 00:15.920
Go

00:16.000 --> 00:17.080
I'm tired

00:17.160 --> 00:18.440
All withdraw

00:18.520 --> 00:19.560
I

00:19.640 --> 00:21.040
Take my leave

00:25.500 --> 00:36.000
Upon returning to his residence, Xie Jian'an swiftly drafted a new monthly imperial budget and rebuilt the imperial harem of Emperor Xuan, gathering the realm's finest beauties for you and constructing pavilions of jade.

00:36.080 --> 00:39.000
Overriding all objections, Xie Xuan executed the rebellious magnates, calming the northern populace and elevating Great Xuan's martial prestige.

00:45.120 --> 00:46.520
Your Majesty

00:46.640 --> 00:48.760
Whose plaque will you turn tonight?

